~ fizzbuzz, vibes style ~

new vibes is_divisible(a, b)
vibes on
  sending vibes a / b vibe match int(a / b)
vibes off

vibing through i in range(1, 16)
vibes on
  it's giving is_divisible(i, 15)
  vibes on
    manifesting "fizzbuzz"
  vibes off
  or it's giving is_divisible(i, 3)
  vibes on
    manifesting "fizz"
  vibes off
  or it's giving is_divisible(i, 5)
  vibes on
    manifesting "buzz"
  vibes off
  or not
  vibes on
    manifesting str(i)
  vibes off
vibes off
